-- title:
--   OAI.Saxl.saxl_kronecker_pos: intermediate lemma from OpenAI, Universal Tensor Squares for Symmetric Groups (result family 205)
-- statement:
--   An intermediate lemma of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.UniversalTensorSquares.universal_tensor_square`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development for this platform. The statement and its proof are OpenAI's (OpenAI, *Universal Tensor Squares for Symmetric Groups (result family 205)*, OpenAI Math Release, September 24, 2026, result family 205, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math), Apache License 2.0); in Lean it is the declaration `OAI.Saxl.saxl_kronecker_pos` of [lean/OAI/RepresentationTheory/Saxl/Main.lean](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/7ef5c0cc5ca4b0e072b7a050fca09ab24bc6fa3a/lean/OAI/RepresentationTheory/Saxl/Main.lean) at commit 7ef5c0c, ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a.
--
--   **The statement**, as published (namespace `OAI.Saxl`, with `open scoped TensorProduct`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem saxl_kronecker_pos (m : ℕ) (hm : 1 ≤ m) (μ : YoungDiagram)
--       (hμ : μ.card = m * (m + 1) / 2) :
--       0 < kronecker (canonicalTableau (staircase m) (staircase_card m))
--         (canonicalTableau (staircase m) (staircase_card m)) (canonicalTableau μ hμ)
--   ```
--
--   **Definitions.** The statement is written with `OAI.Saxl.staircase` (definitions bundle `OAIQ259US000` of this split); `OAI.Saxl.staircase_card` (definitions bundle `OAIQ259US007` of this split); `OAI.Saxl.canonicalTableau` and `OAI.Saxl.kronecker` (the published bundle `Def_UniversalTensorSquares`).
